                                    <h1>BIS Hallmarking + HUID for D2C Jewelry Brands — Complete Compliance Guide 2026 | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #ff5722;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#ea580c;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD JEWELRY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live jewelry vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for jewelry brands</a> with a delivered <a href="/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Fabelia jewelry D2C case study</a>, 8+ published jewelry playbooks including <a href="/resources/Gold_vs_Diamond_Jewelry_D2C_Strategy_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Gold vs Diamond D2C Strategy</a>, <a href="/resources/Jewelry_D2C_Digital_Transformation_India_Dubai_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jewelry D2C Digital Transformation India + Dubai</a>, <a href="/resources/Best_D2C_Jewellery_Brands_UAE_GCC_2026_2027.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Best D2C Jewellery Brands UAE + GCC</a>, and city-specific jewelry marketing pages across <a href="/services/gcc/dubai-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/abu-dhabi-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Abu Dhabi</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/dammam-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dammam</a>, and <a href="/services/gcc/al-khobar-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Al Khobar</a>. Every framework below is grounded in live category work &mdash; not generic D2C theory.</div><p>BIS Hallmarking + HUID (Hallmark Unique Identification) has been mandatory for gold jewelry above 2 grams in India since 2022. Non-compliance = product seizure, marketplace delisting, refused platform access, reputational damage. Yet dozens of D2C jewelry brands still launch without proper BIS registration, hoping to "fix it later" &mdash; and pay 3-5x the cost when it bites.</p><p>This piece walks through the full BIS + HUID compliance process for D2C jewelry brands &mdash; registration, per-SKU workflow, display requirements, Shopify + marketplace integration, and how to build compliance as a marketing asset rather than a burden.</p>
                                    <h2>What BIS + HUID actually requires</h2>
                                    <p><strong>BIS (Bureau of Indian Standards):</strong> Government-mandated jewelry hallmarking standard. Applies to gold + silver jewelry sold in India above 2 grams.</p><p><strong>HUID:</strong> 6-digit alphanumeric unique identification stamped on every hallmarked piece. Traceable via BIS-CARE app + BIS website. Mandatory since 2022 for gold. Silver HUID being phased in.</p><p><strong>What must be marked on the piece:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>BIS logo (assay + hallmarking centre mark)</li><li>Purity + fineness (22K916, 18K750, 14K585, etc.)</li><li>Assay + hallmarking centre identification mark</li><li>HUID (6 characters)</li></ul><p><strong>Where it goes on-site:</strong> Display all four elements + downloadable BIS certificate on every SKU page. HUID must be entered by buyer or displayed for verification via BIS-CARE app.</p>
                                    <h2>Registration process &amp;mdash; how to get BIS-registered</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Step 1 (Weeks 1-2):</strong> Apply for BIS jeweller registration on <a href="https://manakonline.in" rel="nofollow">manakonline.in</a> BIS portal. Business documents required: GST certificate, PAN, business address proof, gold + silver trader license.</p><p><strong>Step 2 (Weeks 2-3):</strong> BIS inspector visits business premises for verification. Physical inspection + document validation.</p><p><strong>Step 3 (Weeks 3-4):</strong> BIS registration certificate issued after approval. Valid for 5 years, renewable.</p><p><strong>Step 4 (Ongoing):</strong> Pieces sent to BIS-recognised Assay + Hallmarking Centre (AHC) for testing + hallmarking + HUID marking. Turnaround 24-72 hours typically.</p><p><strong>Registration fee:</strong> Rs 4,000-Rs 12,000 initial (varies by scale + turnover) + Rs 1,500-Rs 6,000 renewal every 5 years.</p><p><strong>Per-piece hallmarking fee (at AHC):</strong> Rs 45 + GST per gold piece. Rs 25 + GST for silver.</p>
                                    <h2>Per-SKU workflow &amp;mdash; from manufacture to Shopify</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Workflow for a D2C brand:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Design + manufacture piece in-house or via manufacturer partner.</li><li>Send batch to nearest AHC for testing + hallmarking + HUID.</li><li>Receive back with BIS logo + purity + HUID stamped + accompanying certificate.</li><li>Photograph piece (see <a href="/resources/jewelry_product_photography_360_ar_d2c.php">photography playbook</a>) including hallmark macro shot.</li><li>Upload to Shopify with HUID entered in SKU-level custom field.</li><li>SKU page auto-displays BIS badge + HUID number + certificate PDF download.</li><li>Package + ship with certificate.</li></ul><p><strong>Timeline:</strong> Add 3-5 days per batch for AHC turnaround. Plan inventory + launch calendar around this. Bulk batches (100+ pieces) get priority processing at most AHCs.</p>
                                    <h2>Turning compliance into a marketing asset</h2>
                                    <p>Most brands treat BIS + HUID as a burden. Winning brands use it as a trust signal + educational content lever:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Dedicated /trust-and-compliance page:</strong> BIS registration + HUID process + AHC partner + certificate library. Downloadable proof.</li><li><strong>Product page badges:</strong> "BIS Hallmarked" + "HUID Verified" prominent above CTA.</li><li><strong>Educational content:</strong> "How to verify BIS hallmark on your jewelry" + "What HUID means for you" + "Reading your certificate" &mdash; long-tail SEO + trust content.</li><li><strong>Video walkthrough:</strong> Founder + gemologist explaining hallmark + certificate. YouTube + Instagram.</li><li><strong>QR code on certificate:</strong> Links to BIS-CARE verification. Removes buyer friction on verification.</li><li><strong>Marketplace listings:</strong> Amazon + Flipkart + Nykaa Fashion require BIS-verified accounts. Being registered opens marketplace channels.</li></ul>
                                    <h2>Common compliance failures + how to avoid them</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Failure 1: "We'll register after launch."</strong> Marketplaces refuse listings without BIS. Meta + Google ad accounts get flagged for jewelry claims without BIS proof. Register in weeks 1-4 of build.</p><p><strong>Failure 2: HUID missing on SKU page.</strong> Buyers verify via BIS-CARE and find no match &rarr; refund + brand-damage complaint. Every SKU must have HUID in Shopify custom field.</p><p><strong>Failure 3: Under-2g pieces marked "hallmarked."</strong> Under-2g gold pieces exempt from BIS. Marking them as hallmarked when they're not = misrepresentation. Clearly separate hallmarked vs non-hallmarked in catalog.</p><p><strong>Failure 4: Silver marketed as BIS-hallmarked without HUID.</strong> Silver HUID being phased in. Check current BIS notification before claiming.</p><p><strong>Failure 5: Lab-grown diamond jewelry gold-hallmarked but stone uncertified.</strong> Gold portion needs BIS. Stone needs IGI / GIA / SGL. Both separately. Buyers expect both.</p>

                                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #fff;">
                                        <h3 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:15px;">Ready to Get Started?</h3>
                                        <p style="color:#ccc;margin-bottom:25px;">Book a free 30-minute jewelry D2C discovery call. We map your brand + funnel + share a customised proposal within 3 working days.</p>
                                        <a href="https://www.itdgrowthlabs.com/contact-us.php" style="background:#ff5722;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;">Contact Us Today</a>
                                        <a href="https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="js-book-call" data-source="blog_cta" style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;">Book Free 30-min Call</a>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is BIS hallmarking + HUID mandatory for a D2C jewelry brand in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for gold jewelry above 2 grams. Mandatory since 2022. Non-compliance = product seizure + marketplace delisting + refused platform access + reputational damage. Silver HUID being phased in. Register in weeks 1-4 of brand build, before first order.</p>
                                        <h3>How do I get BIS registration for a jewelry business?</h3>
                                        <p>Apply on manakonline.in BIS portal. Business documents needed: GST, PAN, business address proof, gold + silver trader license. BIS inspector visits premises for verification. Registration certificate issued after approval. Valid 5 years, renewable. Total 3-4 weeks + Rs 4,000-Rs 12,000 initial fee.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does BIS hallmarking cost per piece?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 45 + GST per gold piece + Rs 25 + GST per silver piece at BIS-recognised Assay + Hallmarking Centre (AHC). Turnaround 24-72 hours per batch typically. Bulk batches (100+) get priority processing.</p>
                                        <h3>What must be displayed on my Shopify SKU page for BIS compliance?</h3>
                                        <p>BIS logo + purity + HUID number + downloadable BIS certificate PDF. Every SKU page. HUID number in Shopify custom field auto-displays on product page. Buyer can verify HUID via BIS-CARE app or BIS website.</p>
                                        <h3>Can I sell jewelry without BIS on Amazon + Flipkart?</h3>
                                        <p>No. Amazon India + Flipkart + Nykaa Fashion + Ajio + Myntra all require BIS-verified seller accounts for jewelry categories. Being unregistered blocks marketplace distribution entirely.</p>
                                        <h3>Does BIS apply to lab-grown diamond jewelry?</h3>
                                        <p>Gold + silver setting portion needs BIS + HUID. Lab-grown diamond stone needs IGI / GIA / SGL certification separately. Both certifications must be displayed. Neither replaces the other.</p>
                                        <h3>How can BIS + HUID become a marketing asset instead of a burden?</h3>
                                        <p>Dedicated /trust-and-compliance page with certificate library. Product page badges ("BIS Hallmarked" + "HUID Verified") above CTA. Educational content ("How to verify BIS hallmark" + "What HUID means") for long-tail SEO. QR code on certificate linking to BIS-CARE verification. Video walkthrough on YouTube + Instagram.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD GrowthLabs help with BIS + HUID compliance for D2C jewelry brands?</h3>
                                        <p>Registration coordination + AHC partner identification + Shopify SKU-level HUID field setup + trust page + compliance content library + certificate PDF template + marketplace listing verification. Compliance built as trust asset from day one. See our <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php">jewelry vertical page</a>.</p>
